# The dev container is built with the repository as its context, because the Dockerfile copies
# pyproject.toml and uv.lock from here; the context directory .devcontainer/ cannot reach them.
# Everything else stays out: the build trees and .pio directories make a working copy several
# hundred megabytes, all of which would be sent to the daemon on every build for two files.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
